#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apps for the App Center"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: Apps für das App Center"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:9
msgid ""
"__As of: 2026-11-04 · OpenEMS version 2026.12.0-SNAPSHOT (development "
"version, branch develop)__"
msgstr ""
"__Stand: 04.11.2026 · OpenEMS-Version 2026.12.0-SNAPSHOT (Entwicklungsstand, "
"Branch develop)__"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:11
msgid ""
"An app is the guided setup of a function in the App Center. It shows a form, "
"creates components from the inputs and enters Controllers in the Scheduler. "
"The control logic itself is not in the app, but in the component it creates "
"(see xref:development/implementing/controller.adoc[Implementing a "
"Controller]). `+FixActivePower+` (small, one Controller), "
"`+AppWeatherPrediction+` (checks before installation) and `+AppHeatMyPv+` "
"(number fields) serve as templates."
msgstr ""
"Eine App ist die geführte Einrichtung einer Funktion im App Center. Sie "
"zeigt ein Formular, legt aus den Eingaben Komponenten an und trägt "
"Controller in den Scheduler ein. Die Regel-Logik selbst steckt nicht in der "
"App, sondern in der Komponente, die sie anlegt (siehe xref:development/"
"implementing/controller.adoc[Eigene Komponente oder Controller]). Als "
"Vorlagen dienen `+FixActivePower+` (klein, ein Controller), "
"`+AppWeatherPrediction+` (Prüfungen vor der Installation) und "
"`+AppHeatMyPv+` (Zahlenfelder)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where apps are located"
msgstr "Wo Apps liegen"

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Apps are OSGi components in the bundle `+io.openems.edge.core+`, source code "
"under `+src/io/openems/edge/app/<area>/+`. The framework is in "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.appmanager+`."
msgstr ""
"Apps sind OSGi-Komponenten im Bundle `+io.openems.edge.core+`, Quellcode "
"unter `+src/io/openems/edge/app/<Bereich>/+`. Der Rahmen liegt in "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.appmanager+`."

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:18
msgid ""
"**UI:** The form comes as a JSON description from the Edge "
"(`+getAppAssistant+`). For a new app, nothing needs to be changed in `+ui/+` "
"and no new UI build is necessary."
msgstr ""
"**Oberfläche:** Das Formular kommt als JSON-Beschreibung von der Edge "
"(`+getAppAssistant+`). Für eine neue App ist in `+ui/+` nichts zu ändern und "
"kein neuer UI-Build nötig."

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:19
msgid ""
"**No separate bundle:** The core bundle only releases the package "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.price+` (`+Export-Package+` in the manifest). Another "
"bundle therefore cannot import the classes under `+appmanager+`. A new app "
"therefore means a new Edge JAR; it cannot be installed individually, for "
"example via FileInstall."
msgstr ""
"**Kein eigenes Bundle:** Das Core-Bundle gibt nur das Paket "
"`+io.openems.edge.core.price+` frei (`+Export-Package+` im Manifest). Die "
"Klassen unter `+appmanager+` kann ein anderes Bundle deshalb nicht "
"importieren. Eine neue App bedeutet also ein neues Edge-JAR; sie lässt sich "
"nicht einzeln nachinstallieren, etwa über FileInstall."

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:20
msgid ""
"**No registration:** The `+AppManagerImpl+` dynamically binds all OSGi "
"services of type `+OpenemsApp+` (`+bindApp+`). There is no app list."
msgstr ""
"**Keine Registrierung:** Der `+AppManagerImpl+` bindet alle OSGi-Dienste vom "
"Typ `+OpenemsApp+` dynamisch (`+bindApp+`). Eine App-Liste gibt es nicht."

#. type: #sec-where-apps-are-located
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:21
msgid ""
"**Component:** The app only names the component as text via its Factory-ID. "
"The bundle of the component must also be in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+`, otherwise it "
"is missing from the JAR."
msgstr ""
"**Komponente:** Die App nennt die Komponente nur über ihre Factory-ID als "
"Text. Das Bundle der Komponente muss zusätzlich in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+` "
"stehen, sonst fehlt es im JAR."

