#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Properties and form fields"
msgstr "Eigenschaften und Formularfelder"

#. type: #sec-properties-and-form-fields
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:139
msgid ""
"Each value of the enum `+Property+` is a property of the app. The name of "
"the enum value is also the key in JSON (`+\"ESS_ID\": \"ess0\"+`). The "
"behavior is described by an `+AppDef+`:"
msgstr ""
"Jeder Wert des Enums `+Property+` ist eine Eigenschaft der App. Der Name des "
"Enum-Werts ist zugleich der Schlüssel im JSON (`+\"ESS_ID\": \"ess0\"+`). "
"Das Verhalten beschreibt ein `+AppDef+`:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:169
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Call\n"
"| Effect\n"
"\n"
"| `+AppDef.componentId(\"ctrl0\")+`\n"
"| Property for a Component-ID with this default value. `+getId(t, p, Property.X)+` returns the stored value or the default value. Without a field, so it does not appear in the form.\n"
"| `+CommonProps.alias()+`\n"
"| field for the alias\n"
"| `+AppDef.copyOfGeneric(CommonProps.defaultDef(), def -> …)+`\n"
"| starting point for your own property\n"
"| `+setTranslatedLabel(\"key\")+`, `+setTranslatedDescription(\"key\")+`\n"
"| text from the translation files\n"
"| `+setTranslatedLabelWithAppPrefix(\".x.label\")+`, `+setTranslatedDescriptionWithAppPrefix(\".x.description\")+`\n"
"| as above, the key begins with the app ID\n"
"| `+setDefaultValue(…)+`\n"
"| default value\n"
"| `+setRequired(true)+`\n"
"| mandatory field\n"
"| `+setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildInputFromNameable, (app, property, l, parameter, field) -> …)+`\n"
"| type of field and its settings\n"
"| `+wrapField(…)+`\n"
"| supplements an existing field, e.g. `+field.onlyShowIf(…)+`\n"
"| `+setIsAllowedToSee(AppDef.ofLeastRole(Role.ADMIN))+`\n"
"| field only visible from this role\n"
"| `+setAllowedToSave(false)+`\n"
"| value is not stored in the app instance\n"
"| `+bidirectional(CONTROLLER_ID, \"url\", ComponentManagerSupplier::getComponentManager)+`\n"
"| value is only in the component, not in the app instance. If it is missing in the request, it is read from the component.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Aufruf\n"
"| Wirkung\n"
"\n"
"| `+AppDef.componentId(\"ctrl0\")+`\n"
"| Eigenschaft für eine Komponenten-ID mit diesem Standardwert. `+getId(t, p, Property.X)+` liefert den gespeicherten Wert oder den Standardwert. Ohne Feld, erscheint also nicht im Formular.\n"
"| `+CommonProps.alias()+`\n"
"| Feld für den Alias\n"
"| `+AppDef.copyOfGeneric(CommonProps.defaultDef(), def -> …)+`\n"
"| Ausgangspunkt für eine eigene Eigenschaft\n"
"| `+setTranslatedLabel(\"schlüssel\")+`, `+setTranslatedDescription(\"schlüssel\")+`\n"
"| Text aus den Übersetzungsdateien\n"
"| `+setTranslatedLabelWithAppPrefix(\".x.label\")+`, `+setTranslatedDescriptionWithAppPrefix(\".x.description\")+`\n"
"| wie oben, der Schlüssel beginnt mit der App-ID\n"
"| `+setDefaultValue(…)+`\n"
"| Standardwert\n"
"| `+setRequired(true)+`\n"
"| Pflichtfeld\n"
"| `+setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildInputFromNameable, (app, property, l, parameter, field) -> …)+`\n"
"| Art des Feldes und seine Einstellungen\n"
"| `+wrapField(…)+`\n"
"| ergänzt ein vorhandenes Feld, z. B. `+field.onlyShowIf(…)+`\n"
"| `+setIsAllowedToSee(AppDef.ofLeastRole(Role.ADMIN))+`\n"
"| Feld nur ab dieser Rolle sichtbar\n"
"| `+setAllowedToSave(false)+`\n"
"| Wert wird nicht in der App-Instanz gespeichert\n"
"| `+bidirectional(CONTROLLER_ID, \"url\", ComponentManagerSupplier::getComponentManager)+`\n"
"| Wert liegt nur in der Komponente, nicht in der App-Instanz. Fehlt er in der Anfrage, wird er aus der Komponente gelesen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:172
msgid ""
"Ready-made properties for selecting components are in `+ComponentProps+`, "
"e.g. `+pickManagedSymmetricEssId()+`, `+pickElectricityMeterId()+` and "
"`+pickElectricityGridMeterId()+`. They list the enabled components and take "
"the first as the default value."
msgstr ""
"Fertige Eigenschaften zur Auswahl von Komponenten stehen in "
"`+ComponentProps+`, z. B. `+pickManagedSymmetricEssId()+`, "
"`+pickElectricityMeterId()+` und `+pickElectricityGridMeterId()+`. Sie "
"listen die aktivierten Komponenten und nehmen die erste als Standardwert."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:174
msgid ""
"**Field types** from `+JsonFormlyUtil+`, among others: "
"`+buildInputFromNameable+`, `+buildSelectFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildCheckboxFromNameable+`, `+buildRangeFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildDateTimeFromNameable+`, `+buildRepeatFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildFieldGroupFromNameable+`."
msgstr ""
"**Feldarten** aus `+JsonFormlyUtil+`, unter anderem: "
"`+buildInputFromNameable+`, `+buildSelectFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildCheckboxFromNameable+`, `+buildRangeFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildDateTimeFromNameable+`, `+buildRepeatFromNameable+`, "
"`+buildFieldGroupFromNameable+`."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:176
msgid "**Number field** (from `+AppHeatMyPv+`):"
msgstr "**Zahlenfeld** (aus `+AppHeatMyPv+`):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:189
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MAX_HEAT_POWER(AppDef.copyOfGeneric(CommonProps.defaultDef(), appDef -> appDef //\n"
"\t\t.setDefaultValue(3000) //\n"
"\t\t.setRequired(true) //\n"
"\t\t.setTranslatedLabelWithAppPrefix(\".maxHeatPower.label\") //\n"
"\t\t.setTranslatedDescriptionWithAppPrefix(\".maxHeatPower.description\"))\n"
"\t\t.setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildInputFromNameable,\n"
"\t\t\t\t(app, property, l, parameter, field) -> field.setInputType(NUMBER)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setMin(0)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setMax(9000)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setUnit(Unit.WATT, l))), //\n"
msgstr ""
"MAX_HEAT_POWER(AppDef.copyOfGeneric(CommonProps.defaultDef(), appDef -> appDef //\n"
"\t\t.setDefaultValue(3000) //\n"
"\t\t.setRequired(true) //\n"
"\t\t.setTranslatedLabelWithAppPrefix(\".maxHeatPower.label\") //\n"
"\t\t.setTranslatedDescriptionWithAppPrefix(\".maxHeatPower.description\"))\n"
"\t\t.setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildInputFromNameable,\n"
"\t\t\t\t(app, property, l, parameter, field) -> field.setInputType(NUMBER)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setMin(0)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setMax(9000)//\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t.setUnit(Unit.WATT, l))), //\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:192
msgid ""
"`+setMin+` and `+setMax+` only accept whole numbers; `+InputBuilder+` has no "
"setting for the step size. Inputs can be checked with "
"`+setValidation(pattern, message)+` via a regular expression. This check "
"belongs to the form; values from a direct JSON-RPC request do not go through "
"it."
msgstr ""
"`+setMin+` und `+setMax+` nehmen nur ganze Zahlen; eine Einstellung für die "
"Schrittweite bietet `+InputBuilder+` nicht. Eingaben lassen sich mit "
"`+setValidation(muster, meldung)+` über einen regulären Ausdruck prüfen. "
"Diese Prüfung gehört zum Formular; Werte aus einer direkten JSON-RPC-Anfrage "
"durchlaufen sie nicht."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:194
msgid ""
"**Selection with your own entries:** The entries are a JSON array with "
"`+label+` and `+value+`; `+SelectBuilder.setOptions+` sets it:"
msgstr ""
"**Auswahl mit eigenen Einträgen:** Die Einträge sind ein JSON-Array mit "
"`+label+` und `+value+`; `+SelectBuilder.setOptions+` setzt es:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:211
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
".setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildSelectFromNameable, (app, property, l, parameter, field) -> {\n"
"\tfinal var options = JsonUtils.buildJsonArray() //\n"
"\t\t\t.add(JsonUtils.buildJsonObject() //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"label\", translate(parameter.bundle(), \"App.X.Y.default\")) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"value\", \"\") //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.build());\n"
"\tfor (var meter : app.getComponentUtil().getEnabledComponentsOfType(ElectricityMeter.class)) {\n"
"\t\toptions.add(JsonUtils.buildJsonObject() //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.add(\"label\", DEFAULT_COMPONENT_2_LABEL.apply(meter)) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"value\", meter.id()) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.build());\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tfield.setOptions(options.build());\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
".setField(JsonFormlyUtil::buildSelectFromNameable, (app, property, l, parameter, field) -> {\n"
"\tfinal var options = JsonUtils.buildJsonArray() //\n"
"\t\t\t.add(JsonUtils.buildJsonObject() //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"label\", translate(parameter.bundle(), \"App.X.Y.default\")) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"value\", \"\") //\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t.build());\n"
"\tfor (var meter : app.getComponentUtil().getEnabledComponentsOfType(ElectricityMeter.class)) {\n"
"\t\toptions.add(JsonUtils.buildJsonObject() //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.add(\"label\", DEFAULT_COMPONENT_2_LABEL.apply(meter)) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.addProperty(\"value\", meter.id()) //\n"
"\t\t\t\t.build());\n"
"\t}\n"
"\tfield.setOptions(options.build());\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:214
msgid ""
"**Note with a mandatory checkbox** during installation: "
"`+CommonProps.installationHint(…)+` shows a text with a checkbox and does "
"not store the value. With `+field.requireTrue(l)+` and "
"`+field.onlyShowIf(Exp.currentModelValue(CONTROLLER_ID).isNull())+`, it only "
"appears as long as the app does not yet have a Component-ID (example: "
"`+CleverPvProps.privacyPolicy+`)."
msgstr ""
"**Hinweis mit Pflicht-Haken** bei der Installation: "
"`+CommonProps.installationHint(…)+` zeigt einen Text mit Checkbox und "
"speichert den Wert nicht. Mit `+field.requireTrue(l)+` und "
"`+field.onlyShowIf(Exp.currentModelValue(CONTROLLER_ID).isNull())+` "
"erscheint er nur, solange die App noch keine Komponenten-ID hat (Beispiel: "
"`+CleverPvProps.privacyPolicy+`)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:216
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating the configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration erzeugen"

#. type: #sec-creating-the-configuration
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:219
msgid ""
"`+appPropertyConfigurationFactory()+` converts the properties into tasks. "
"The function receives the target `+t+`, the values `+p+` and the language "
"`+l+`."
msgstr ""
"`+appPropertyConfigurationFactory()+` wandelt die Eigenschaften in Aufgaben "
"um. Die Funktion erhält das Ziel `+t+`, die Werte `+p+` und die Sprache "
"`+l+`."

#. type: #sec-creating-the-configuration
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:221
msgid ""
"**`+ConfigurationTarget+`:** `+ADD+`, `+UPDATE+`, `+VALIDATE+`, `+DELETE+`, "
"`+TEST+`. Values that should only be set during installation are limited "
"with `+.onlyIf(t == ConfigurationTarget.ADD, b -> …)+`; a later change of "
"the app then does not overwrite them."
msgstr ""
"**`+ConfigurationTarget+`:** `+ADD+`, `+UPDATE+`, `+VALIDATE+`, `+DELETE+`, "
"`+TEST+`. Werte, die nur bei der Installation gesetzt werden sollen, "
"begrenzt man mit `+.onlyIf(t == ConfigurationTarget.ADD, b -> …)+`; so "
"überschreibt ein späteres Ändern der App sie nicht."

#. type: #sec-creating-the-configuration
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:222
msgid ""
"**Reading values:** `+getString+`, `+getStringOrNull+`, `+getInt+`, "
"`+getDouble+`, `+getBoolean+`, `+getEnum+`, `+getJsonArray+`. They return "
"the passed value or the default value of the `+AppDef+`."
msgstr ""
"**Werte lesen:** `+getString+`, `+getStringOrNull+`, `+getInt+`, "
"`+getDouble+`, `+getBoolean+`, `+getEnum+`, `+getJsonArray+`. Sie liefern "
"den übergebenen Wert oder den Standardwert des `+AppDef+`."

#. type: #sec-creating-the-configuration
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:223
msgid ""
"**Property names of the component:** The keys are the OSGi names: "
"`+meter_id()+` in the `+Config+` becomes `+\"meter.id\"+`."
msgstr ""
"**Property-Namen der Komponente:** Die Schlüssel sind die OSGi-Namen: aus "
"`+meter_id()+` in der `+Config+` wird `+\"meter.id\"+`."

#. type: #sec-creating-the-configuration
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:224
msgid ""
"**Tasks** (`+Tasks+`): `+component+`, `+schedulerByCentralOrder+`, "
"`+scheduler+`, `+staticIp+`, `+cluster+`, `+persistencePredictor+`, "
"`+predictorManagerByCentralOrder+`."
msgstr ""
"**Aufgaben** (`+Tasks+`): `+component+`, `+schedulerByCentralOrder+`, "
"`+scheduler+`, `+staticIp+`, `+cluster+`, `+persistencePredictor+`, "
"`+predictorManagerByCentralOrder+`."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:226
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduler order"
msgstr "Scheduler-Reihenfolge"

#. type: #sec-scheduler-order
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:229
msgid ""
"If the app creates a Controller with `+Tasks.schedulerByCentralOrder+`, its "
"Factory-ID must be in `+ProductionSchedulerOrderDefinition+`:"
msgstr ""
"Legt die App einen Controller mit `+Tasks.schedulerByCentralOrder+` an, muss "
"seine Factory-ID in `+ProductionSchedulerOrderDefinition+` stehen:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:233
#, no-wrap
msgid ".thenByFactoryId(\"Controller.Ess.FixActivePower\") //\n"
msgstr ".thenByFactoryId(\"Controller.Ess.FixActivePower\") //\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:236
msgid ""
"If the entry is missing, the installation aborts with `+Unhandled "
"component+`. The position in the list determines the order in which the "
"Controllers run (see xref:development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-"
"power.adoc[Cycle, Scheduler and ESS Power])."
msgstr ""
"Fehlt der Eintrag, bricht die Installation mit `+Unhandled component+` ab. "
"Die Position in der Liste legt die Reihenfolge fest, in der die Controller "
"laufen (siehe xref:development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc[Zyklus, "
"Scheduler und Leistungsverteilung])."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dependencies on other apps"
msgstr "Abhängigkeiten zu anderen Apps"

#. type: #sec-dependencies-on-other-apps
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:241
msgid ""
"If an app needs another one, it enters a `+DependencyDeclaration+` "
"(`+.addDependencies(…)+` on `+AppConfiguration.create()+`; examples: "
"`+HeatPump+`, `+HeatingElement+`). `+CreatePolicy+` determines when the "
"dependent app is created: `+ALWAYS+`, `+IF_NOT_EXISTING+` or `+NEVER+`. In "
"addition, there are `+UpdatePolicy+`, `+DeletePolicy+`, "
"`+DependencyUpdatePolicy+` and `+DependencyDeletePolicy+`."
msgstr ""
"Braucht eine App eine andere, trägt sie eine `+DependencyDeclaration+` ein "
"(`+.addDependencies(…)+` am `+AppConfiguration.create()+`; Beispiele: "
"`+HeatPump+`, `+HeatingElement+`). `+CreatePolicy+` legt fest, wann die "
"abhängige App angelegt wird: `+ALWAYS+`, `+IF_NOT_EXISTING+` oder `+NEVER+`. "
"Dazu kommen `+UpdatePolicy+`, `+DeletePolicy+`, `+DependencyUpdatePolicy+` "
"und `+DependencyDeletePolicy+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:243
#, no-wrap
msgid "Category, cardinality, permissions, checks"
msgstr "Kategorie, Anzahl, Rechte, Prüfungen"

#. type: #sec-category-cardinality-permissions-checks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:246
msgid ""
"**`+getCategories()+`:** category in the App Center, values from "
"`+OpenemsAppCategory+`, e.g. `+API+`, `+ESS+`, `+HEAT+`, `+METER+`, "
"`+PREDICTION+`."
msgstr ""
"**`+getCategories()+`:** Rubrik im App Center, Werte aus "
"`+OpenemsAppCategory+`, z. B. `+API+`, `+ESS+`, `+HEAT+`, `+METER+`, "
"`+PREDICTION+`."

#. type: #sec-category-cardinality-permissions-checks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:247
msgid ""
"**`+getCardinality()+`:** `+SINGLE+` (one instance of this app), "
"`+SINGLE_IN_CATEGORY+` (one instance per category), `+MULTIPLE+` (any "
"number)."
msgstr ""
"**`+getCardinality()+`:** `+SINGLE+` (eine Instanz dieser App), "
"`+SINGLE_IN_CATEGORY+` (eine Instanz je Kategorie), `+MULTIPLE+` (beliebig "
"viele)."

#. type: #sec-category-cardinality-permissions-checks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:248
msgid ""
"**`+getAppPermissions()+`:** Without overriding, `+canSee+` and "
"`+canDelete+` apply from `+OWNER+`, `+canInstall+` for `+OWNER+`, "
"`+INSTALLER+` and `+ADMIN+`. `+FixActivePower+` only shows the app to admins "
"(`+setCanSee(Role.ADMIN)+`)."
msgstr ""
"**`+getAppPermissions()+`:** Ohne Überschreiben gilt `+canSee+` und "
"`+canDelete+` ab `+OWNER+`, `+canInstall+` für `+OWNER+`, `+INSTALLER+` und "
"`+ADMIN+`. `+FixActivePower+` zeigt die App nur Admins "
"(`+setCanSee(Role.ADMIN)+`)."

#. type: #sec-category-cardinality-permissions-checks
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:250
msgid ""
"**Checks** are set by `+getValidateBuilder()+`, building blocks are in "
"`+Checkables+`:"
msgstr ""
"**Prüfungen** setzt `+getValidateBuilder()+`, Bausteine stehen in "
"`+Checkables+`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:259
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"@Override\n"
"protected ValidatorConfig.Builder getValidateBuilder() {\n"
"\treturn ValidatorConfig.create() //\n"
"\t\t\t.setInstallableCheckableConfigs(Checkables.check3rdPartyAccessAccepted()) //\n"
"\t\t\t.setCompatibleCheckableConfigs(Checkables.checkCoordinatesSet());\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"@Override\n"
"protected ValidatorConfig.Builder getValidateBuilder() {\n"
"\treturn ValidatorConfig.create() //\n"
"\t\t\t.setInstallableCheckableConfigs(Checkables.check3rdPartyAccessAccepted()) //\n"
"\t\t\t.setCompatibleCheckableConfigs(Checkables.checkCoordinatesSet());\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:262
msgid "From this, `+Validator+` calculates the status of the app:"
msgstr "Daraus berechnet `+Validator+` den Status der App:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:278
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Status\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"| Display in the App Center\n"
"\n"
"| `+INCOMPATIBLE+`\n"
"| A `+Compatible+` check fails.\n"
"| list of incompatible apps, **only visible to admins** (`+index.component.ts+`)\n"
"| `+COMPATIBLE+`\n"
"| Only an `+Installable+` check fails.\n"
"| available, installation is rejected\n"
"| `+INSTALLABLE+`\n"
"| All checks passed.\n"
"| available\n"
msgstr ""
"| Status\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"| Anzeige im App Center\n"
"\n"
"| `+INCOMPATIBLE+`\n"
"| Eine `+Compatible+`-Prüfung schlägt fehl.\n"
"| Liste „Inkompatibel“, **nur für Admins sichtbar** (`+index.component.ts+`)\n"
"| `+COMPATIBLE+`\n"
"| Nur eine `+Installable+`-Prüfung schlägt fehl.\n"
"| verfügbar, Installation wird abgelehnt\n"
"| `+INSTALLABLE+`\n"
"| Alle Prüfungen bestanden.\n"
"| verfügbar\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:281
msgid ""
"A failed `+Compatible+` check therefore makes the app disappear for owners. "
"Checks that the user can solve themselves therefore fit better with "
"`+Installable+`."
msgstr ""
"Eine fehlgeschlagene `+Compatible+`-Prüfung lässt die App also für Owner "
"verschwinden. Prüfungen, die der Benutzer selbst lösen kann, passen deshalb "
"eher zu `+Installable+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:283
#, no-wrap
msgid "Texts, link and image"
msgstr "Texte, Link und Bild"

#. type: #sec-texts-link-and-image
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:286
msgid ""
"In `+translation_de.properties+` and `+translation_en.properties+` under `+…/"
"core/appmanager/+`; umlauts are stored directly in UTF-8:"
msgstr ""
"In `+translation_de.properties+` und `+translation_en.properties+` unter `+…/"
"core/appmanager/+`; Umlaute stehen dort direkt in UTF-8:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:291
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"App.Cloud.Clever-PV.Name = clever-PV\n"
"App.Cloud.Clever-PV.Name.short = clever-PV\n"
msgstr ""
"App.Cloud.Clever-PV.Name = clever-PV\n"
"App.Cloud.Clever-PV.Name.short = clever-PV\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:294
msgid ""
"The name comes from `+<app ID>.Name+`, the short form from `+<app "
"ID>.Name.short+`. Missing keys are found by the test `+TestTranslations+` if "
"the app is entered there."
msgstr ""
"Der Name kommt aus `+<App-ID>.Name+`, die Kurzform aus `+<App-"
"ID>.Name.short+`. Fehlende Schlüssel findet der Test `+TestTranslations+`, "
"wenn die App dort eingetragen ist."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:296
msgid ""
"**Website link:** `+getAppDescriptor+` fetches it via "
"`+OpenemsEdgeOem.getAppWebsiteUrl+`. For OpenEMS, `+OpenemsEdgeOemImpl+` "
"inherits the table from `+DummyOpenemsEdgeOem+`. "
"`+TestTranslations.testOemWebsiteUrl+` requires an entry for each app "
"entered there; an empty link is sufficient:"
msgstr ""
"**Website-Link:** `+getAppDescriptor+` holt ihn über "
"`+OpenemsEdgeOem.getAppWebsiteUrl+`. Für OpenEMS erbt `+OpenemsEdgeOemImpl+` "
"die Tabelle aus `+DummyOpenemsEdgeOem+`. "
"`+TestTranslations.testOemWebsiteUrl+` verlangt für jede dort eingetragene "
"App einen Eintrag; ein leerer Link genügt:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:303
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
".put(\"App.Cloud.Clever-PV\", AppLink.create() //\n"
"\t\t.emptyLink(Language.DE) //\n"
"\t\t.emptyLink(Language.EN) //\n"
") //\n"
msgstr ""
".put(\"App.Cloud.Clever-PV\", AppLink.create() //\n"
"\t\t.emptyLink(Language.DE) //\n"
"\t\t.emptyLink(Language.EN) //\n"
") //\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:306
msgid ""
"**Image:** `+getImage()+` looks for `+<ClassName>.png+` in the package of "
"the class. If the file is missing, it returns `+null+`."
msgstr ""
"**Bild:** `+getImage()+` sucht `+<Klassenname>.png+` im Paket der Klasse. "
"Fehlt die Datei, liefert es `+null+`."

