#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:365
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation and Backend"
msgstr "Installation und Backend"

#. type: #sec-installation-and-backend
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:368
msgid ""
"The installation registers the Edge with the Backend "
"(`+AppManagerImpl.handleAddAppInstanceRequest+` → "
"`+addInstallAppInstanceHistory+`). If no Backend is connected, it aborts "
"with `+Backend not connected!+`. Exceptions are installations without a key "
"of apps that an installed app lists as a dependency with "
"`+CreatePolicy.NEVER+` (`+getFreeApps+`)."
msgstr ""
"Die Installation meldet die Edge beim Backend an "
"(`+AppManagerImpl.handleAddAppInstanceRequest+` → "
"`+addInstallAppInstanceHistory+`). Ist kein Backend verbunden, bricht sie "
"mit `+Backend not connected!+` ab. Ausgenommen sind Installationen ohne "
"Schlüssel von Apps, die eine installierte App als Abhängigkeit mit "
"`+CreatePolicy.NEVER+` führt (`+getFreeApps+`)."

#. type: #sec-installation-and-backend
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:370
msgid ""
"**Without a Backend**, the form can still be viewed in the App Center. An "
"instance can also be entered directly in the property `+apps+` of the "
"component `+Core.AppManager+`, a JSON array:"
msgstr ""
"**Ohne Backend** lässt sich das Formular trotzdem im App Center ansehen. "
"Eine Instanz kann man außerdem direkt in die Eigenschaft `+apps+` der "
"Komponente `+Core.AppManager+` eintragen, ein JSON-Array:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:374
#, no-wrap
msgid "[{\"appId\":\"App.Ess.FixActivePower\",\"alias\":\"Power setpoint\",\"instanceId\":\"<UUID>\",\"properties\":{\"CTRL_FIX_ACTIVE_POWER_ID\":\"ctrlFixActivePower0\",\"ESS_ID\":\"ess0\"}}]\n"
msgstr "[{\"appId\":\"App.Ess.FixActivePower\",\"alias\":\"Leistungsvorgabe\",\"instanceId\":\"<UUID>\",\"properties\":{\"CTRL_FIX_ACTIVE_POWER_ID\":\"ctrlFixActivePower0\",\"ESS_ID\":\"ess0\"}}]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:377
msgid ""
"According to the description of this property, such changes only take effect "
"on the components when the app is updated via the UI or JSON-RPC. Existing "
"entries must remain in the array."
msgstr ""
"Laut Beschreibung dieser Eigenschaft wirken solche Änderungen erst auf die "
"Komponenten, wenn die App über die Oberfläche oder per JSON-RPC aktualisiert "
"wird. Vorhandene Einträge müssen im Array bleiben."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:379
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checklist"
msgstr "Checkliste"

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:382
msgid ""
"Create the app class under `+io.openems.edge.core/src/io/openems/edge/app/"
"<area>/+`."
msgstr ""
"App-Klasse unter `+io.openems.edge.core/src/io/openems/edge/app/<Bereich>/+` "
"anlegen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:383
msgid ""
"Enter `+<app ID>.Name+`, `+.Name.short+` and all field texts in both "
"translation files."
msgstr ""
"`+<App-ID>.Name+`, `+.Name.short+` und alle Feldtexte in beide "
"Übersetzungsdateien eintragen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:384
msgid ""
"Enter the Factory-ID in `+ProductionSchedulerOrderDefinition+` if a "
"Controller is added via `+schedulerByCentralOrder+`."
msgstr ""
"Factory-ID in `+ProductionSchedulerOrderDefinition+` eintragen, falls ein "
"Controller über `+schedulerByCentralOrder+` eingereiht wird."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:385
msgid "Add the link in `+DummyOpenemsEdgeOem+`."
msgstr "Link in `+DummyOpenemsEdgeOem+` ergänzen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:386
msgid "Check the bundle of the component in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+`."
msgstr "Bundle der Komponente in `+EdgeApp.bndrun+` prüfen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:387
msgid "Add `+Apps.java+`, `+TestTranslations+` and your own test."
msgstr "`+Apps.java+`, `+TestTranslations+` und einen eigenen Test ergänzen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:388
msgid "Run tests and Checkstyle."
msgstr "Tests und Checkstyle ausführen."

#. type: #sec-checklist
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:389
msgid ""
"`+./gradlew buildEdge+`; the new JAR must run on the Edge for the app to "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"`+./gradlew buildEdge+`; das neue JAR muss auf der Edge laufen, damit die "
"App erscheint."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:391
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the app does not appear"
msgstr "Wenn die App nicht erscheint"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/implementing/apps.adoc:404
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Cause\n"
"| Check\n"
"\n"
"| The Edge runs with a JAR without the app, e.g. the official Docker image.\n"
"| Compare the checksum of the JAR (see xref:development/deployment/docker.adoc[Running in Docker]) or query `+getApps+`.\n"
"| Status `+INCOMPATIBLE+` and login without the Admin role.\n"
"| Log in as admin and view the list of incompatible apps.\n"
"| `+canSee+` requires a higher role.\n"
"| Check `+getAppPermissions()+`.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ursache\n"
"| Prüfung\n"
"\n"
"| Die Edge läuft mit einem JAR ohne die App, z. B. dem offiziellen Docker-Image.\n"
"| Prüfsumme des JARs vergleichen (siehe xref:development/deployment/docker.adoc[Betrieb in Docker]) oder `+getApps+` abfragen.\n"
"| Status `+INCOMPATIBLE+` und Anmeldung ohne Admin-Rolle.\n"
"| Als Admin anmelden und die Liste „Inkompatibel“ ansehen.\n"
"| `+canSee+` verlangt eine höhere Rolle.\n"
"| `+getAppPermissions()+` prüfen.\n"
